I mean, she swears that it's her light and fast reflexes that came to her rescue.

00:05:34.699 --> 00:05:36.699
So you're saying this blur saved Lois from becoming roadkill.

00:05:36.699 --> 00:05:38.699
from becoming roadkill, and she didn't feel a thing.

